# FreeLang Self-Hosting Bootstrap ✅

> **A compiler that can compile itself.**
>
> Proven through 8 progressive stages with automated JSON verification.

---

## 🎯 What Is This?

This repository demonstrates that **FreeLang can be written in FreeLang and compiled by itself**.

Through 8 carefully designed stages, we prove:
- ✅ Deterministic compilation (v1 ≡ v2 ≡ v3)
- ✅ Type system support (struct definitions)
- ✅ Complex expressions (binary operators with precedence)
- ✅ Complete bootstrap chain (source → v1 → v2 → v3)

**All proofs are automated and JSON-documented.**

